{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46872","headline":"怀巴陵 · 齐己","name":"怀巴陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂白堪思大乱前，薄游曾驻洞庭边。\n寻僧古寺沿沙岸，倚杖残阳落水天。\n兰蘂蔫菸骚客庙，烟波晴阔钓师船。\n此时欲买君山住，嬾就商人乞个钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}